    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορν-ευτός</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορονευτός</span></b> , q. v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned on a lathe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					977
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.402v
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.440
			</span></i>: written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορυνευτός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				1.64
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fit for turning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι</span>”
